# Mad Skills

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) in this repository.

Critical when creating or editing skills:

- YAML frontmatter `description` / `name`: **ASCII only** (no raw emoji or ZWJ). Non-ASCII in `description` has crashed Cursor.
- Skill body: use GitHub/GitLab `:shortcode:` names from https://github.com/ikatyang/emoji-cheat-sheet — never raw emoji characters.
